OL,3,APlaying loud music on the bus? That
OL,4,Awill cost you hundreds of dollars in
OL,5,ASingapore
OL,6,
OL,7,FBus passengers in Singapore can now be
OL,8,Ffined up to $500 Singapore dollars
OL,9,F($391; #293) for placing their feet on
OL,10,Fseats or playing loud audio, as well as
OL,11,Feating, drinking or littering onboard.
OL,13,FA fine of up to $5,000 will be imposed
OL,14,Ffor more serious offences, such as
OL,15,Fcausing obstruction or danger to fellow
OL,16,Fcommuters within bus terminals or "the
OL,17,Fsoiling of any part of a public bus,
OL,18,Fbus interchange, or terminal".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
