OL,3,APlaying loud music on the bus? That
OL,4,Awill cost you hundreds of dollars in
OL,5,ASingapore
OL,6,
OL,7,F"These will foster a safer, more
OL,8,Fconsiderate and pleasant public
OL,9,Ftransport environment for all," the
OL,10,FLand Transport Authority (LTA) said in
OL,11,Fa news release.
OL,13,FThe new regulations, announced on
OL,14,FMonday, align with existing rules on
OL,15,FSingapore's railway, or Mass Rapid
OL,16,FTransit (MRT), network.
